      "sourceTextSha256": "108d4ee3d417d27c4ebf6969e638b78dadec354ccad0902b6397509d440764d7",
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on a sightseeing tour of Buenos Aires.\n\nThe route follows Avenida 9 de Julio, home to the Teatro Colón and the Obelisk, and continues to Plaza de Mayo, where you will see the Casa Rosada, the Metropolitan Cathedral and the Cabildo, the historic town hall. The tour also takes in Plaza San Martín, Avenida Alvear and Plaza del Congreso.\n\nContinue along Avenida de Mayo and Avenida Corrientes to see La Boca and San Telmo, followed by the more modern and upscale districts of Palermo, Recoleta and Puerto Madero, with their restaurants and places to stroll.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-986f3332f46d53ddb5737edd",
        "model": "Codex GPT-6"
